WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.636 --> 00:00:09.060
One day a poor man came to visit an effendi while he was having tea.

2
00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:15.406
Effendi is a title of respect for a well-educated or wealthy man in the Middle East.

3
00:00:16.226 --> 00:00:20.730
The poor man said, "Effendi Nasreddin, I need your help.

4
00:00:21.591 --> 00:00:23.273
I don't know if you will help me.

5
00:00:23.293 --> 00:00:26.836
I am a poor man, a man with no money."

6
00:00:29.116 --> 00:00:31.138
The effendi looked at the man kindly.

7
00:00:31.158 --> 00:00:33.820
"I will help you," he said.

8
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.942
"Tell me, what is wrong?"

9
00:00:36.902 --> 00:00:41.146
The poor man looked tired and hungry, and it took him a while to begin.

10
00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:45.289
"I have a problem He paused suddenly.

11
00:00:45.309 --> 00:00:49.893
"Yes," said the effendi gently, "go on."

12
00:00:53.075 --> 00:00:58.420
"Yesterday I stopped in front of the door of a restaurant," the poor man said.

13
00:00:59.232 --> 00:01:01.394
"The restaurant belonged to a rich man.

14
00:01:02.094 --> 00:01:02.995
I ate nothing.

15
00:01:03.575 --> 00:01:05.136
I only smelled the food.

16
00:01:05.897 --> 00:01:08.278
However, the owner came out and noticed me.

17
00:01:08.959 --> 00:01:16.524
He said I was enjoying his food, and and he wanted me to pay him for the food."

18
00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:19.906
The poor man stopped.

19
00:01:20.706 --> 00:01:22.367
He turned his head and coughed.

20
00:01:23.308 --> 00:01:28.852
The effendi wondered if the man was crying, but he waited patiently for the man to continue.

21
00:01:29.716 --> 00:01:33.859
"Please, finish your story when you are ready," said the effendi.

22
00:01:33.879 --> 00:01:38.262
"Well," continued the poor man.

23
00:01:38.282 --> 00:01:43.326
"I, of course, had no money with me, so I couldn't pay him.

24
00:01:44.166 --> 00:01:45.587
He became very angry.

25
00:01:46.308 --> 00:01:48.869
He shouted and shouted until the judge came.

26
00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:52.032
The judge said I must appear in court today.

27
00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:54.753
He will tell me how I am to be punished.

28
00:01:55.674 --> 00:01:59.956
Please, effendi," begged the poor man, "can you help me?

29
00:02:00.797 --> 00:02:02.597
Can you say something to the judge?"

30
00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:10.719
The effendi offered the man some tea, and he sat thinking quietly while the man drank.

31
00:02:11.419 --> 00:02:17.221
When the man had finished his tea, the effendi spoke: "Yes, I will go to court with you.

32
00:02:17.681 --> 00:02:18.161
Let's go."

33
00:02:19.041 --> 00:02:20.082
And they left together.

34
00:02:22.923 --> 00:02:27.904
When the effendi and the poor man got to court, the rich man was already there.

35
00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:29.881
He was waiting for them.

36
00:02:30.902 --> 00:02:37.708
As soon as the rich man saw the poor man, he began shouting angrily, "This man owes me

37
00:02:37.768 --> 00:02:39.289
the price of one dinner!

38
00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:41.271
I want my money!

39
00:02:41.992 --> 00:02:43.914
These beggars are all alike!

40
00:02:44.634 --> 00:02:46.136
They live off the work of others!"

41
00:02:48.498 --> 00:02:51.360
It took the judge several minutes to calm the rich man down.

42
00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:54.023
"You see how angry he is?"

43
00:02:54.603 --> 00:02:55.324
said the judge.

44
00:02:56.308 --> 00:02:59.571
"You have filled yourself up on the smell of his restaurant.

45
00:03:00.472 --> 00:03:02.253
Yet you have not even paid him.

46
00:03:03.134 --> 00:03:04.715
You must pay him right now."

47
00:03:06.297 --> 00:03:10.240
After the effendi heard what the judge said, he stepped forward.

48
00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:15.885
He looked at the rich man and said, "Oh, sir, do not be so upset.

49
00:03:16.745 --> 00:03:19.348
This poor man is my brother, my elder brother.

50
00:03:20.108 --> 00:03:24.472
He is a poor man and he cannot pay you, so I will pay you instead."

51
00:03:26.616 --> 00:03:30.058
After he heard this, the rich man smiled a greedy smile.

52
00:03:30.938 --> 00:03:33.360
The effendi took a bag of coins from his belt.

53
00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:37.482
He bent down next to the rich man and shook the bag of coins.

54
00:03:38.423 --> 00:03:39.883
The coins jingled loudly.

55
00:03:39.903 --> 00:03:43.265
"Listen," said the effendi.

56
00:03:43.285 --> 00:03:45.066
"Do you hear that sound?"

57
00:03:45.086 --> 00:03:47.287
"Of course I hear!"

58
00:03:47.968 --> 00:03:49.528
said the rich man impatiently.

59
00:03:49.549 --> 00:03:54.371
"Well, then," answered the effendi, "the problem is solved.

60
00:03:54.891 --> 00:03:55.772
The debt is paid.

61
00:03:56.688 --> 00:04:00.290
My brother has smelled your food, and you have heard his money."

62
00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:01.831
The judge nodded.

63
00:04:02.471 --> 00:04:04.372
He was satisfied with the exchange.

64
00:04:05.913 --> 00:04:10.936
If the poor man only smelled the rich man's food, the rich man could only charge him the

65
00:04:10.996 --> 00:04:11.997
sound of his money.

66
00:04:13.197 --> 00:04:18.440
Afterward, the effendi took the arm of the poor man and handed him the bag of gold coins.

67
00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:24.904
"Go, my brother," said the effendi, "and taste the food you have smelled so much of."

68
00:04:25.725 --> 00:04:28.391
The poor man bowed respectfully and left.
